#: class/class-mainwp-system-view.php:937
msgid "Keep MainWP Child up to date"
msgstr "A MainWP Child bővítmény naprakészen tartása"

#: class/class-mainwp-system-view.php:938
msgid ""
"Enable automatic updates for MainWP Child on connected sites to improve "
