#: pages/backup/page-mainwp-backup-task-form.php:432
msgid ""
"For large sites, Tar GZip is the safer choice. Zip rewrites the whole "
"archive after every slice, so it gets slower as the backup grows and needs "
"as much free disk as the archive itself. Tar GZip appends instead."
